{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2021-08-12 08:42:00', 'title': 'GRAHAM ROBINSON JOINS NORTHROP GRUMMAN BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'FALLS CHURCH, VA., AUG. 12, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (NYSE: NOC) ANNOUNCED IT HAS ELECTED GRAHAM ROBINSON TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS. ROBINSON IS THE SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND PRESIDENT OF STANLEY INDUSTRIAL, A BUSINESS SEGMENT OF STANLEY BLACK & DECKER, A POSITION HE HAS HELD SINCE APRIL 2020.'}